  "title": {
    "zh": "钟楼封签接力",
    "en": "Bell Tower Seal Relay"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "四枚封签、顺序签收、两条巡线",
    "en": "Four seals, ordered receipts and two patrols"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "收齐四枚封签并到出口。验收清单按 amber、slate、pearl、jade 排列。按清单顺序提交四个签收号，每个都要查同一份 stamps 字典。 限 30 回合，避开巡逻。scan() 列出巡线、目标坐标和 compass 方向表。第二张地图将图纸旋转半圈。",
    "en": "Recover all four seals and reach the exit. The receipt manifest lists amber, slate, pearl and jade in that order. Submit their four receipt numbers in manifest order, looking each up in the same stamps dictionary. Avoid patrols within 30 turns. scan() lists patrol cycles, goal locations and the compass for plan directions. The second map rotates the plan by 180 degrees."
  },
